From 130f2ecb3a3ea9f1752a65dad219bd9f040569f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritvik <ritvik2014@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:47:50 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 20/38] render: liquid glass material ported from MacShell

The material is now a port of MacShell's liquidglass.frag
(https://github.com/0-ss/MacShell, MIT): squircle bezel slope capped at 7
over 1.45x the bezel, Snell refraction (refract, n 1.5) sampled inward,
thickness*1.35, per-channel dispersion (0.6x), a vertical lens of the whole
slab, saturation 1.25, tint mix toward dark grey, milky lift, top sheen,
darker lower inner edge, edge absorption, specular rim (top-left key,
hairline + wide), meniscus, grain, soft drop shadow. The two v2 slots
become tint (tintMix) and rim tint (rimTint).
---
 resources/lumen-glass-v1.xml                 |   7 +-
 src/protocols/lumen_glass.rs                 |  16 +-
 src/render_helpers/liquid_glass.rs           |   8 +-
 src/render_helpers/shaders/liquid_glass.frag | 207 +++++++++----------
 4 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 126 deletions(-)

