           specular: 0..1, the light along the rim
         and, with 16 per shape (version 2):
-          magnify: 0..0.9, how much the whole shape magnifies what is behind
-            toward its centre (default 0)
-          falloff: the exponent of the edge's bend fading inward (default 2)
-          rim width: how wide the rim light is, px (default 1.2)
+          magnify: 0..0.9, the whole shape as a gentle vertical lens (default 0)
+          tint: 0..1, flat tint mixed into the glass (default 0.23)
+          rim tint: 0..1, the rim white (0) or a brighter shade of the glass (1)
       </description>
       <arg name="shapes" type="array"/>
